## Academic calculation testing

Verify attendance, marks, grades, SGPA and CGPA against known examples and the configured college rules.

## Notification testing

Test scheduled notifications, permission denial, time changes and device restarts.

## Backup testing

Verify exported files, restore operations and attachment integrity.

## Security testing

Verify authentication, authorization, data isolation and file access restrictions.

